This project implements a BERT-based text classification model on the 20 Newsgroups dataset using PyTorch and HuggingFace Transformers.

The repository includes:

• Custom BERT classifier architecture  
• Text preprocessing and cleaning pipeline  
• Head-Tail truncation strategy (MAX_LEN = 256)  
• Mixed precision training (AMP)  
• Label smoothing and weight decay for generalization  
• Confidence scoring using Softmax probabilities  
• Temperature Scaling for calibration  
• Expected Calibration Error (ECE) evaluation  
• Domain shift testing (modern text dataset)  
• Selective prediction ("Other" class via confidence threshold)  

The project focuses not only on classification accuracy but also on model reliability, calibration, and robustness under distribution shift.
